{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813960/extras/fa1382b19593a584e019f4ca3353e305.poster.avif?t=1760144560\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813960/extras/fa1382b19593a584e019f4ca3353e305.webm?t=1760144560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813960/extras/fa1382b19593a584e019f4ca3353e305.mp4?t=1760144560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ragga-Dagga</strong> is a <strong>top-down action roguelite</strong> that focuses on fast-paced melee combat. Discover runes and armor that'll grant you abilities to aid you on your glorious journey. Interact with NPCs who may offer special, unique events that may reward you with something cool in return! Fight hard bosses as you traverse through these endless dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time, a dungeon doorframe that towers even mountains, suddenly appeared in the middle of nowhere. Many adventurers entered the doorframe, seeking to explore what lies in the depths.. but none have ever returned... Except...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth and freely loose movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responsive melee combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throwable blade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runes that grant unique activatable abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armor that provides unique passive abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactable NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-based gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3813960?t=1760144560","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813960/b78ba38eeecaf36c0dcd4d2e13dd0471f6e776b8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760144560","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813960/4362bcfcd1b858e95c10761a1c688d931c8f1add/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760144560","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813960/4362bcfcd1b858e95c10761a1c688d931c8f1add/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760144560","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813960/extras/fa1382b19593a584e019f4ca3353e305.poster.avif?t=1760144560\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813960/extras/fa1382b19593a584e019f4ca3353e305.webm?t=1760144560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813960/extras/fa1382b19593a584e019f4ca3353e305.mp4?t=1760144560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ragga-Dagga</strong> is a <strong>top-down action roguelite</strong> that focuses on fast-paced melee combat. Discover runes and armor that'll grant you abilities to aid you on your glorious jour